STATE.md

# Derived spec-tree artifacts — regenerated from .wai/specs/, never authored.
# `wairon diagram --all` rebuilds the whole diagram set; `wairon generate`
# rebuilds the rest. Tracking them put ~1.3 MB of rendered output in the repo
# and made every regeneration a commit that carried no design change.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately: .wai/lock.json (the gate's record — `promote`
# re-checks the live state against it, so a clone without it cannot promote)
# and .wai/context/*.md (agent-facing guidance people read on GitHub).
.wai/docs/diagrams/
.wai/generated/